      "status": "published",
      "summary": "Thanks to your athleticism, you have Advantage on Initiative rolls and Strength (Athletics) checks.\n\nIn addition, immediately after you score a Critical Hit, you can move up to half your Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks.",
      "effects": []
