      "status": "published",
      "summary": "Fighting Style Feat (Prerequisite: Fighting Style Feature)\n\nWhen you make an extra attack as a result of using a weapon that has the Light property, you can add your ability modifier to the damage of that attack if you aren’t already adding it to the damage.",
      "effects": []
